    {
     "raw": "]P 005[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Now that you've saved the crisis on Savara and earned the"
    },
    {
     "raw": "help of Transon Lohk, you head back to Tyrian to find out"
    },
    {
     "raw": "more about this new power."
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "How could such an innocent pile of rocks be used to"
    },
    {
     "raw": "devastate planets?"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "You must locate a sample of this new energy.  If nothing"
    },
    {
     "raw": "else, perhaps it could be harnessed back against Microsol's"
    },
    {
     "raw": "new device."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]M 005[",
     "command": "M"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 005[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "There, on the far side of Tyrian.  A sample?"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "Looks like a fairly substantial... oh no!"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "                     MICROSOL!"
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
