  {
   "section": 42,
   "marker": "*42SECTION - EndGame?",
   "lines": [
    {
     "raw": "]M 008[",
     "command": "M"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 009[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "That was too close. You've been nearly vaporized, crushed,"
    },
    {
     "raw": "blown to pieces, flame broiled, and electrocuted one too"
    },
    {
     "raw": "many times. Only your incredible targeting skills and class"
    },
    {
     "raw": "1 fancy flying has kept you alive."
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "Those boys at Deliani clearly have some even more hair "
    },
    {
     "raw": "raising missions for you up their sleeve. Why were YOU"
    },
    {
     "raw": "chosen to be their errand boy?  Why is half the galaxy after"
    },
    {
     "raw": "your head? Can you beat the odds and, most importantly, can"
    },
    {
     "raw": "you survive without becoming space bacon?"
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]M 022[",
     "command": "M"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]U 008[",
     "command": "U"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "If not, things could become unpleasant."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]2 026[",
     "command": "2"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]n[",
     "command": "n"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]F[",
     "command": "F"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]M 038[",
     "command": "M"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 009[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "This is Rob Neither with the daily news."
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "Zinglon's Ale has been stolen!"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "The Grand Moolah Yimbo revealed today that all of their"
    },
    {
     "raw": "god, Zinglon's, holy ale has been abducted.  Millions of"
    },
    {
     "raw": "thirsty worshippers fled in panic when the news hit."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 009[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "A panic-stricken Savaran citizen:"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "\"I nearly fainted when I heard the news.  How can we"
    },
    {
     "raw": "continue to believe in a just universe and freedom to"
    },
    {
     "raw": "eat crackers if we have no ale?  I don't know yet what"
    },
    {
     "raw": "I'm going to do.\""
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 009[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "This is certainly a crisis of grand proportions.  All"
    },
    {
     "raw": "other work has stopped."
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "The Grand Moolah has told us that someone must retrieve"
    },
    {
     "raw": "the ale from the clutches of Dai-Zan, the god of deceit"
    },
    {
     "raw": "and bad form.  Who will save us from this torment?"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "My Zinglon, I need a drink!"
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]i 038[",
     "command": "i"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]J 040[",
     "command": "J"
    }
   ]
